+## Decision table
 
 | Observation | Verdict |
 |---|---|
-| Owning repo has unpushed commits touching the artifact's path, or a dirty worktree over it | `NOT-SAFE` — live work; record and skip |
-| Artifact's last commit is an ancestor of `origin/<default>` | `SAFE(pushed)` — removable after quarantine |
-| Ledger row matches path + hash | `SAFE(moved-to-obsidian)` — source copy removable |
-| Scratch type + zero live references + older than lane's last admitted round | `SAFE(stale)` — removable |
-| Anything else, any doubt, any credential-shaped content | `NOT-SAFE` — stay silent in the dry run |
+| Secret-shaped path component (`*.env`, `.env`, `.env.*`, `.envrc`, `*credential*`, `*secret*`, `id_*`, `*.pem`; case-insensitive), before any read | `NOT-SAFE(secrets-refusal)` |
+| Repo-root, ledger pair fails, unpushed > 0 | `NOT-SAFE(unpushed)` |
+| Repo-root, unpushed = 0, dirty > 0 | `NOT-SAFE(dirty)` |
+| Repo-root, clean, no ledger pair | `NOT-SAFE(none)` — a pushed lane repo is not removable |
+| Worktree, named branch unpushed > 0 | `NOT-SAFE(unpushed-branch)` |
+| Worktree, dir absent, unique = 0, and no unpushed named branch | `SAFE(metadata-prune)` |
+| Worktree, dir present | `NOT-SAFE(dirty)` or `NOT-SAFE(none)` |
+| File exists; introducing commit is an ancestor of the resolved remote default ref | `SAFE(pushed)`, then the operator dirty gate |
+| File exists; no remote-tracking default ref | `NOT-SAFE` (verify: `pushed-unverifiable`; vault-verify: `none`, evidence notes unverifiable) |
+| Vault-verify ledger pair holds, digests symlink-clean | `VERIFIED(moved-to-obsidian)` |
+| Scratch family, age > `--stale-days`, tool refs = 0 | `SAFE(stale)`, then the operator `--hidden` gate |
+| Missing path, vault-verify has no ledger match | `NOT-SAFE(unreachable)` |
+| Anything else, any doubt | `NOT-SAFE` |
 
