-  stays with the operator (kura is unminted).
-- Credentials, tokens, `op://` refs, `.env` content — kagi's province; souji
-  cites paths and modes only.
-- Operator config (`~/.config/**`), the driver (`scripts/`), `.ufo/state/`,
