+- History rewrite (`reset --hard`, rebase, amend of published commits). Operator-owned; kura is unminted.
+- `git fetch`, `push`, `commit`, `branch`, `checkout`, `reset`, or `rebase` inside a verifier.
+- Credentials, tokens, `op://` refs, `.env` content. Kagi's province. Cite paths and modes only. Never read secret-shaped content, including a ledger vault path that points at one.
+- Operator config (`~/.config/**`), the driver (`scripts/`), `.ufo/state/`, `.ufo/watchdog.log`.
